What is Django? 🐍🌐

Django is a high-level Python web framework used to build websites and web applications quickly.

It provides many built-in features, so developers do not need to create everything from scratch.

======

Simple definition

Python + Django = Build powerful web applications

What can Django build?
🛒 E-commerce websites
🎓 College management systems
👨‍🎓 Student portals
🏥 Hospital systems
📰 News websites
💬 Chat applications
🗄️ Database-driven applications
🔐 Login and user authentication systems

========

How Django works
User / Browser
      ↓
Django Application
      ↓
Business Logic
      ↓
Database
      ↓
Response / Web Page

======

Main Django components

| Component          | Use                                      |
| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |
| **Models**         | Define and manage database data          |
| **Views**          | Handle application logic                 |
| **Templates**      | Create HTML pages                        |
| **URLs**           | Connect URLs to application functions    |
| **Admin Panel**    | Manage data through a built-in dashboard |
| **Authentication** | User login, logout, permissions, etc.    |


